WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.637
Why does this gate need code?

2
00:00:01.637 --> 00:00:04.783
The guide's Gate 6 configures
the leaver in Book

3
00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:07.687
3's order and asks for
the timing to be proved.

4
00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:09.988
But no Microsoft report computes it.

5
00:00:09.988 --> 00:00:13.063
Lifecycle Workflows records
that a run completed.

6
00:00:13.063 --> 00:00:15.975
The audit log records when
the account was disabled.

7
00:00:15.975 --> 00:00:20.475
The card system and Intune record
the rest, each in its own place.

8
00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:22.829
So this chapter computes the intervals:

9
00:00:22.829 --> 00:00:27.252
each leaver's time to block and time to
revocation, the period's percentiles

10
00:00:27.252 --> 00:00:31.730
against the thresholds, and the
separations that need someone's attention.
